==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is an [[Aku Altar (Enemy Base)|Aku Altar]].
*2 [[Shibalien Elite]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
**4 [[Star Peng]]s spawn, delay 20~23.33 seconds<sup>600f~700f</sup>.
**2 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Project A]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Make sure to have most, though preferably all of your [[Cats of the Cosmos]] Chapters 1-3 [[Anti-Starred Alien Treasures]], as the Starred Aliens may overwhelm you otherwise, even if they aren't the main threat. Taking out the Fallen Bear is your main priority. Afterwards, the stage is basically free. If your seal level is above 30 and you have a decent lineup, you've already won.

Be aware that this stage is fairly cash tight, so it's best you stall for a bit to get your wallet up.

===Recommended Ubers===
*[[Radiant Aphrodite (Uber Rare Cat)|Megaphrodite]] - Aphrodite can easily melt Project A and gradually chip down the Fallen Bear. Just make sure to protect her well, since the Aku Gories and Star Pengs may get to her.
*[[Mighty Rekon Korps (Uber Rare Cat)|Orbital Annihilator Ragnarok]] - Ragnarok not only outranges everything in this stage, but can also quickly take down the Fallen Bear in about 4-6 hits or so at level 30, though getting Ragnarok to it may be an issue. He can still work before True Form but is outranged by Project A by exactly 1.
*[[Yamii (Uber Rare Cat)|Yaminora]] - Yaminora targets both traits in this stage, and with his massive health pool against them and weaken, he can nullify their pushing power. He works in his Evolved form too, but most enemies in this stage have high DPS, so he cannot tank as well. His weaken is also blocked by both Shields and Barriers.

